  "headline": "Adenosine is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale East has 5.9 days of 3 mg/mL 2 mL vials and Corvale General has 15.4 days",
  "headline_cites": ["D7", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include adenosine as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 99 vials of adenosine 3 mg/mL 2 mL solution with a daily use of 16.9 vials, giving 5.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 235 vials of the same presentation with a daily use of 15.2 vials, giving 15.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both sites' inventory is labeled by Gland Pharma Limited (NDC 68083015610).",
      "cites": ["E3", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gland Pharma Limited's registered plant (FEI 3002647489) was last inspected 2024-07-25 and classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E21", "E20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked action is to transfer 21 vials of 3 mg/mL 2 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would leave Corvale General with 14 days and bring Corvale East to 7 days.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    }
  ]
